# Build-time configuration for a release build of the app.
#
# Both values are publishable by design: `EXPO_PUBLIC_*` is inlined into the
# JavaScript bundle, so it already ships inside every APK anybody can download
# and unzip. A "secret" here would be no secret at all. The service-role key is
# not used by this project, or by anywhere else in this repository.
#
# Committed for the same reason `admin/.env.production` is. Without it a build
# made anywhere but this working copy — CI, or a fresh clone — has no database,
# and `isLive` is false, and the app comes up on showcase data where signing up
# as a player or a venue answers "This build has no database configured."
# It installs, it runs, and it can do nothing. That is a worse failure than not
# building at all, because it looks like a working app.
#
# `.env` still wins locally and stays ignored, so pointing a personal build at
# another project is unchanged.
EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://ymuknkhapibmtqkrlmia.supabase.co
EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=sb_publishable_Se0BSDnjn_PcJ7__inqR8A_drC0vZ-h
EXPO_PUBLIC_VENUE_ID=0b7a7242-559a-49b9-98b2-5ccd303294ab
EXPO_PUBLIC_PITCH_ID=46d401bf-87aa-45fe-acf5-7a94a05d50b8

# Where the privacy policy, the terms and the account-deletion page are served
# from — the console deployment's own domain, with no trailing slash. Both
# stores check that these open, and the app hides the links until this is real
# rather than shipping a tap that goes nowhere.
EXPO_PUBLIC_LEGAL_BASE_URL=https://PUT-THE-CONSOLE-DOMAIN-HERE
